# docs/ is rendered by `just docs` / CI (shipyard build-docs, then
# build/gen-rules-doc.py for the watches-derived rules/prompts pages); only
# the hand-authored pages below are tracked. An enumerated list of generated
# filenames drifts every time shipyard adds one (_home.md, hooks.md, status.md
# all showed up unlisted), so this ignores the directory and allowlists the
# exceptions instead.
docs/*
!docs/_sidebar.md
!docs/.nojekyll
!docs/favicon.svg
!docs/logo.svg
!docs/README.md

__pycache__
.DS_Store
